WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.368 --> 00:00:14.830
Angie, Susan, Maria, and Kate went to school every morning by car.

2
00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:17.731
Their parents took turns driving them.

3
00:00:18.572 --> 00:00:21.233
One day, Susan's mother drove the girls.

4
00:00:23.013 --> 00:00:28.956
After they arrived at school, Angie said, "I don't want to take the math test today.

5
00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:32.342
Let's go to class an hour late."

6
00:00:37.845 --> 00:00:39.806
idea," said Susan.

7
00:00:39.826 --> 00:00:42.688
"I don't want to take the test either."

8
00:00:47.211 --> 00:00:48.752
do I," said Kate.

9
00:00:48.772 --> 00:00:50.874
"I didn't study."

10
00:00:50.894 --> 00:00:59.840
"I didn't study either," said Maria.

11
00:01:00.204 --> 00:01:03.125
"But what are we going to tell our teacher?

12
00:01:03.745 --> 00:01:06.486
He will be very angry if we come late."

13
00:01:11.587 --> 00:01:14.388
we need a good excuse," said Angie.

14
00:01:14.408 --> 00:01:18.789
"Oh, that's easy," said Susan.

15
00:01:18.809 --> 00:01:22.751
"We'll say that my mother's car had a flat tire."

16
00:01:25.992 --> 00:01:29.601
All the girls agreed: it was the perfect excuse.

17
00:01:32.363 --> 00:01:34.124
So, they waited for an hour.

18
00:01:34.765 --> 00:01:37.947
When they arrived at class, the math test was over.

19
00:01:39.288 --> 00:01:41.349
The teacher was very angry.

20
00:01:41.369 --> 00:01:43.511
"Why are you late?"

21
00:01:44.111 --> 00:01:44.731
he asked.

22
00:01:46.753 --> 00:01:49.054
The girls all started talking at once.

23
00:01:49.715 --> 00:01:54.678
Finally, Susan said, "My mother's car had a flat tire.

24
00:01:55.118 --> 00:01:57.300
We had to wait for her to fix it."

25
00:02:00.168 --> 00:02:02.929
The teacher nodded and said, "Really?

26
00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:06.091
Maria, sit over there in that corner.

27
00:02:06.711 --> 00:02:09.272
Kate, sit over there in that corner.

28
00:02:10.092 --> 00:02:12.173
Angie, sit here in this corner.

29
00:02:12.854 --> 00:02:16.215
And Susan, sit over there in that corner."

30
00:02:18.216 --> 00:02:20.097
The girls did as they were told.

31
00:02:20.117 --> 00:02:27.000
"Now," said the teacher, "take out a piece of paper and a pen.

32
00:02:28.017 --> 00:02:31.304
Each of you write down which tire Susan's mother fixed."

33
00:02:32.146 --> 00:02:33.970
The girls all looked at each other!

34
00:02:34.671 --> 00:02:36.295
They knew they were in trouble!
